{"data":{"body":"**P2 \u2014 Do not swallow inline MDC restoration failures.** With a direct executor, restoration can throw after the result is marked complete; this catch ignores every non-JVM-fatal failure and returns with the caller thread\u2019s MDC cleared or plugin values leaked. Restore through a reliable fallback or propagate for invocation retry before completing the result, and test the complete MDC map afterward.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc77Ki6H","finding_digest":"51b3110768aa57a025405e5f29773d4785c5995e5de3fc606cd430926b507f01","finding_id":"arf_v1_kgzrcb3ivjl2ajkalzpss5z5i6","finding_key":"sdk/execution/durableexecutor::supplyhandler::inline-mdc-restoration-leak","identity_key":"sdk/execution/durableexecutor::supplyhandler::inline-mdc-restoration-leak","line":290,"observation_digest":"f20cbc0f5bfb55c62e96331a579578fc210e05df226a8ac78717efb87f871cb9","observation_id":"aro_v1_6iglyd237nk4mluwgmnfpfly7q","path":"sdk/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/execution/DurableExecutor.java","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_kgzrcb3ivjl2ajkalzpss5z5i6","published_at":"2026-10-08T01:57:28Z","review_id":"arr_v1_5yebu2crhve2yvxvednu65a4hs","reviewed_base_sha":"0c8618e42d3b16e9b7115ab943a93253c0fe936c","reviewed_head_sha":"14db8ae956d155999450c9262eec78bf71d38bdd","reviewer":"codex","start_line":286,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":769},"record_id":"art_v1_bqsfuxsv34ez4mrccjh5g6fzgu","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-08T01:57:28Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
